---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// GitHub, December 2012 fileserver pair with DRBD and STONITH. Facts from the post text.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Three panels of one fileserver pair. Normal: node A is active, node B is passive, the heartbeat link works. A switch upgrade blocks traffic for about a minute and a half, so each side stops hearing the other. Each side decides the other is dead and sends STONITH, and both nodes are powered off.">
    <rect x="10" y="10" width="280" height="280" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="24" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Normal</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Bình thường</tspan></text>
    <rect x="310" y="10" width="280" height="280" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="324" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>2. The switch blocks traffic</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Switch chặn traffic</tspan></text>
    <rect x="610" y="10" width="280" height="280" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="624" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Both shoot first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Cả hai cùng ra tay</tspan></text>
    <rect x="24" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={106} y={60} size={24} />
    <text x="74" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Node A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Node A</tspan></text>
    <text x="74" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>active</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>active</tspan></text>
    <rect x="176" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={258} y={60} size={24} />
    <text x="226" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Node B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Node B</tspan></text>
    <text x="226" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>passive</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>passive</tspan></text>
    <line x1="126" y1="95" x2="174" y2="95" class="edge " />
    <text x="150" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>heartbeat</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>heartbeat</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="196" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>A DRBD pair: only the active</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một cặp DRBD: chỉ node active</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="215" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>node writes. STONITH cuts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được ghi. STONITH cắt điện</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="234" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>the other one's power first.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>node kia trước khi tiếp quản.</tspan></text>
    <rect x="324" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={406} y={60} size={24} />
    <text x="374" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Node A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Node A</tspan></text>
    <text x="374" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>active</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>active</tspan></text>
    <rect x="476" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={558} y={60} size={24} />
    <text x="526" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Node B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Node B</tspan></text>
    <text x="526" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>passive</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>passive</tspan></text>
    <line x1="426" y1="95" x2="474" y2="95" class="edge bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="network" x={450} y={95} size={26} />
    <text x="450" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>no heartbeat</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mất heartbeat</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="196" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>About 1.5 minutes. Each side</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khoảng 1,5 phút. Mỗi bên</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="215" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>passes the timeout and</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vượt timeout và tin rằng</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="234" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>decides the other is dead.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên kia đã chết.</tspan></text>
    <rect x="624" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={706} y={60} size={24} />
    <text x="674" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Node A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Node A</tspan></text>
    <text x="674" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>stopped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã dừng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="776" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={858} y={60} size={24} />
    <text x="826" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Node B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Node B</tspan></text>
    <text x="826" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>stopped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã dừng</tspan></text>
    <line x1="726.0" y1="80.0" x2="765.0" y2="80.0" class="edge bad" /><polygon points="774.0,80.0 765.0,75.5 765.0,84.5" class="head bad" />
    <line x1="774.0" y1="110.0" x2="735.0" y2="110.0" class="edge bad" /><polygon points="726.0,110.0 735.0,114.5 735.0,105.5" class="head bad" />
    <text x="750" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>STONITH, both ways</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>STONITH, hai chiều</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="196" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Both send STONITH and both</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cả hai gửi STONITH và cả hai</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="215" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>nodes stop. Finding the one</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>node dừng. Tìm node có dữ liệu</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="234" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>with the latest data: 5+ hours.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mới nhất: hơn 5 tiếng.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The safety mechanism fired from both sides at once. With nobody left running, finding the node with the latest data took over five hours.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cơ chế an toàn bị kích hoạt từ cả hai phía cùng lúc. Khi không còn node nào chạy, việc tìm node có dữ liệu mới nhất mất hơn năm tiếng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
